  # init-only: dx = sqrt(omega*rearth**2), per-column.

# geopotential_height_wrt_sfc_at_if_to_msl / *_to_msl: [names approx] --
# per-column-and-level z*msl = phis/gravit + z*sfc, no recurrence, would be
# pointwise -- but re-verify the exact scheme name(s) in
# schemes/mmm/mmm_physics_compat.F90 before use; not tagged here to avoid
# proposing a property under a possibly-wrong name.

# bl_gwdo_compat and cu_ntiedtke_compat are deliberately NOT tagged: both
